{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/aqahfb","slide":5,"text":"Walk through the proposed architecture. PrivatePilot detects sensitive content locally, replaces identifiers with placeholders, then sends only safe context for external reasoning. Encryption protects the channel; redaction protects the content."}
